  dialogueList:
  - id: plotInteraction
    text: You can plant seeds and decide what plant to grow! Every plant gives back
      a certain quanitity of seeds. But beware! Enemies will try to destroy your
      plots
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 9
  - id: turretInteraction
    text: You can build turrets and cannons to defend your plots and your base
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 9
  - id: houseInteraction
    text: You must protect your home. If you base's life reaches 0, it's game over!
      After each round, you will get some seeds. Seed profit can be expanded by placing
      windmills
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 9
  - id: defenseInteraction
    text: You can build up your defense by placing barricades and vines. But beware!
      Some enemies might be invulnerable to these
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 9
  - id: windmillInteraction
    text: Build a windmill to multiply your seed profit each round!
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 9
